<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sydney Casino says daily revenues up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sydney Casino says daily revenues up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd (SHC) said on Monday that daily attendances and revenue were up during the first two months of calendar 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;It is clear that the opening of the new car park has made the casino much more accessible and this has led to a significant increase in daly attendances and revenue,&quot; chairman Dick Warburton said in a statement.</p>
</text>
